  "$comment": "Authoritative decision-case table for scripts/port-tick/gates.mjs. Per plugins/port/skills/pipeline/SKILL.md's Mergeability gate, Refresh sweep, Zero-diff review gate, Cycle cap, and Approved pull requests sections.",
